{
  "_comment": "Contract shared by the server (tests/test_evaluation.py -> app/services/evaluation.py, app/utils.parse_float) and the SPA (src/lib/evaluation.test.ts -> src/lib/evaluation.ts). Change both sides together.",
  "evaluate": [
